<TXSPN>Shiyo 800, April 7
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Thank you very much for holding such a grand entrance ceremony today for us, the new students of Motoki Prefectural High School. 
{PAUSE ""}
To the principal, to all the teachers, and to our honored guests, I offer my heartfelt thanks.<PG>
Here in Motoki-cho, famous for its cherry blossoms, the petals are dancing everywhere today as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The scenery surrounding us seemed almost to shine, and on the way to this hall, walking with my mother, 
{PAUSE ""}
each time I found cherry blossoms or other spring flowers, I felt as though every one of them was celebrating us new students.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\体育館.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n-201\r\n60000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
The goshinboku that symbolizes Motoki-cho also seems to be celebrating and encouraging our new lives with its flurry of petals, and I once again feel the joy of being able to go on to a school in Motoki-cho, Sawa Prefecture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Having received such warm words from the principal, our honored guests, and the upper-year students, I am truly deeply moved.<PG>
Until now, I have followed the rails my parents laid for me without a single question.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However, upon entering this school and receiving words from all of you, I have come to wish to gain independence and learning at this school, and to find, without fail, what I myself... 
{PAUSE ""}
want to become in the future. So strongly... 
{PAUSE ""}
Pff... 
{PAUSE ""}
have I come to feel.<PG>
We have... 
{PAUSE ""}
infinite possibilities...
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What lets us... 
{PAUSE ""}
believe so... 
{PAUSE ""}
is flexibility...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Pfft...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Um...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Pffhehe...!
{PLAYSND "環境音\eventhall1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Everyone, I'm sorry! A greeting like this just isn't me after all!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, the new student up on the stage tore up the paper with her speech on it.
{PLAYSND "SE\tearing_papers響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\五島檀上.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\五島檀上手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "-520" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n300\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
