<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "SE\突き飛ばす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{QUAKESTOP "1000"}
{MESON "500"}
The new student slammed both hands down on the lectern, and the sound boomed through the microphone.<PG>
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"I love Motoki-cho!
{PAUSE ""}
　The cherry blossoms are pretty, and the people are all kind. And I'm happy I got into a school in Motoki-cho again!
{PAUSE ""}
　All of you feel the same, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　We've entered a wonderful high school in this wonderful town. The teachers, the parents, the upper-year students, and our honored guests. I'm sure all of these people must be wonderful people too!
{PAUSE ""}
　I'm sorry the new students' representative is someone this off-the-wall, but I want to say it my own way after all, in my own honest words!"<PG>
"I don't know what hardships there will be. I don't know what tough things there will be. 
{PAUSE ""}
But that's exactly why I think it'll be interesting!
{PAUSE ""}
　The only reason I'm standing here is that my entrance exam score was good. 
{PAUSE ""}
I have an amazing senpai who I truly respect, who took me out into a world I didn't know."<PG>
"Let's find our new selves! Let's find new possibilities!
{PAUSE ""}
　Let's find a new world we don't know yet, one test scores alone can't measure!
{PAUSE ""}
　Here, there must be wonderful people who will make that happen!"<PG>
"I'm a troublemaker like this, but please, look after me!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
　Representative of the new students, <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\拍手.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
The hall was filled with loud applause.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\体育館.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
