{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, a message arrived on my phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> had sent it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">“That amazing senpai? Bet that means </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> was grinning at me when I looked her way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s a high school student now too, starting today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She was as tiny as ever, but since the first time we talked, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had changed a lot too.<PG>
When we first talked, I thought she seemed like a gloomy girl who mumbled and couldn't speak clearly, but now she could express herself this openly.
